docs {
  # Send Test Telegram Notifier
  
  Sends a `ping` to Telegram synchronously (surfaces Bot API errors in flash).
  
  **Method:** POST  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/integrations/telegram-notifier-test`  
  **Route name:** `project.integrations.telegram-notifier-test`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`
  
  Requires bot token + chat id under Integrations. Deprecated alias: `POST /settings/project/telegram-notifier-test`.
}
